6. CLIENT LIBRARIES

The thin TCP client libraries — the Python `oxidb` package, the
JavaScript clients, `OxiDb.Client.Tcp` / `OxiDb.Linq` / `OxiDb.Data` on
NuGet, and the Go, Julia, Dart, PHP and Swift clients — are licensed
separately under the MIT license and are not subject to this license.
Talking to the Software from your own application needs no license of
its own.

Packages that bundle the engine itself — `oxidb-embedded` on PyPI,
`OxiDb.Client.Embedded` on NuGet, and the FFI and WASM artifacts —
contain the Software and are governed by this license.


